From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude Fable 5.1" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 8 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] ax630c: fix FDT placement and retry the boot payload

Two boot failures, both measured on hardware, both in the environment
this board ships rather than in any driver.

`fdt_high` and `initrd_high` were `0xffffffffffffffff`. U-Boot warns
about exactly that value -- "known to cause boot failures due to
placement of DT at non-8-byte-aligned addresses. This system will likely
fail to boot" -- and it is not what the board wants anyway. Unset, U-Boot
relocates the device tree against its own `ram_top`, which is the real
1 GiB, and parks it at `0x7e68c000`; a kernel told `mem=512M` cannot map
that, so it dies before any console and before ramoops, leaving nothing
behind to say why. A fixed in-RAM ceiling below the relocation area
removes the dependency on `ram_top` in both directions: the device tree
lands in the first 512 MB whether or not the kernel is given a memory
limit.

The retries are the second fix. Multi-block transfers do not work on this
eMMC controller, so the board runs with `cdns,single-block-only` -- and
single-block reads have a residual failure rate of their own. A 48.8 MiB
kernel is about a hundred thousand of them, and one timeout anywhere in
that run ends the boot with "Error reading cluster". Three attempts turn
a boot that fails roughly half the time into one that does not.

Signed-off-by: open-nanokvm-pro contributors <nanokvm@localhost>
---
 configs/ax630c_nanokvm_pro_defconfig |  2 +-
 include/configs/ax630c.h             | 10 ++++++++--
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/include/configs/ax630c.h b/include/configs/ax630c.h
--- a/include/configs/ax630c.h
+++ b/include/configs/ax630c.h
@@ -224,3 +224,4 @@
-	"initrd_high=0xffffffffffffffff\0"				\
-	"fdt_high=0xffffffffffffffff\0"					\
+	/* A ceiling, NOT ~0 and not unset: both misplace the DT. */	\
+	"initrd_high=0x5f000000\0"					\
+	"fdt_high=0x5f000000\0"						\
 	"bootdev=0\0"							\
diff --git a/configs/ax630c_nanokvm_pro_defconfig b/configs/ax630c_nanokvm_pro_defconfig
--- a/configs/ax630c_nanokvm_pro_defconfig
+++ b/configs/ax630c_nanokvm_pro_defconfig
@@ -49,1 +49,1 @@
-CONFIG_BOOTCOMMAND="if load mmc ${bootdev}:${bootpart} ${scriptaddr} ${extlinux_cfg}; then mw.l ${msreg_set} ${ms_extlinux}; sysboot mmc ${bootdev}:${bootpart} any ${scriptaddr} ${extlinux_cfg}; fi; mw.l ${msreg_set} ${ms_failed}; reset"
+CONFIG_BOOTCOMMAND="if load mmc ${bootdev}:${bootpart} ${scriptaddr} ${extlinux_cfg} || load mmc ${bootdev}:${bootpart} ${scriptaddr} ${extlinux_cfg} || load mmc ${bootdev}:${bootpart} ${scriptaddr} ${extlinux_cfg}; then mw.l ${msreg_set} ${ms_extlinux}; sysboot mmc ${bootdev}:${bootpart} any ${scriptaddr} ${extlinux_cfg} || sysboot mmc ${bootdev}:${bootpart} any ${scriptaddr} ${extlinux_cfg} || sysboot mmc ${bootdev}:${bootpart} any ${scriptaddr} ${extlinux_cfg}; fi; mw.l ${msreg_set} ${ms_failed}; reset"
